{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/5add234626e4afbe3e04f8888abb9c2f.avif?t=1766722816\" width=300 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keepers of Vyrellia is a retro 8-bit deck builder roguelike with '80s vibes, where you can not only customize your deck and weapons, but you can also choose to use your cards in attack mode or defense mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A pulp campaign full of humor and chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the universe of Vyrellia, where tragedy blends with the absurd and every hero feels like they stepped out of an \u201980s pulp magazine\u2026 or a bad tavern joke.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/73cf53bdccb49a1dbaef80ff4df5d059.poster.avif?t=1766722816\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/73cf53bdccb49a1dbaef80ff4df5d059.webm?t=1766722816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/73cf53bdccb49a1dbaef80ff4df5d059.mp4?t=1766722816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/eff6ed74452703dc21d35dadb158ee55.avif?t=1766722816\" width=466 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each one has abilities, motivations, and lines far too epic to be true. Redemption, revenge, or just interrupted vacations?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Mage:</strong> Specialist in elemental and dark magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vanguard:</strong> A resilient warrior who excels in frontal combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue:</strong> Fast and lethal, expert in precise strikes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/957e6f0c8457dff8a05027a431a9b3f4.poster.avif?t=1766722816\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/957e6f0c8457dff8a05027a431a9b3f4.webm?t=1766722816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/957e6f0c8457dff8a05027a431a9b3f4.mp4?t=1766722816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/98f181e46e8e7db6c2fc1a8116cbdc8d.avif?t=1766722816\" width=582 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your deck, combine forbidden powers, and discover absurdly powerful (or useless, depending on your luck) synergies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip your heroes with weapons imbued with ancestral runes and experiment with unique combinations that completely transform your strategy. Each rune unlocks unexpected effects and, when mixed with your cards, multiplies gameplay possibilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with experimental builds, break the balance of the universe (and the game), or fail spectacularly trying,\u00a0 Vyrellia\u2019s magic does not forgive, but it does laugh with you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/366b891f168fd45f30735eb902ca5fe7.poster.avif?t=1766722816\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/366b891f168fd45f30735eb902ca5fe7.webm?t=1766722816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/366b891f168fd45f30735eb902ca5fe7.mp4?t=1766722816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/62dc643f4dc631a3b809debc3ff93249.avif?t=1766722816\" width=360 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shifting maps and the possibility of ruining your fate in a thousand different ways.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/3a549eeeca2d0e9c6f1191bbedcedf03.poster.avif?t=1766722816\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973590/extras/3a549eeeca2d0e9c6f1191bbedcedf03.webm?t=1766722816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"